    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the labor law, in relation to requiring employers to include\nan opioid antagonist in first aid supplies required by federal law; and to\namend a chapter of the laws of 2025 amending the labor law relating to\nrequiring employers to include an opioid antagonist in first aid supplies\nrequired by federal law, as proposed in legislative bills numbers S. 5922-A\nand A. 2725-A, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8770",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8770-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
